---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About Cascadia Systems — operations automation, data systems, and AI engineering, plus a field-data lab, in Portland, Oregon"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero-topo section bg-gradient-to-b from-dark-bg via-dark-surface to-dark-bg">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <h1 class="mb-8 text-center text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">About</h1>
        <div class="mb-8 border-l-4 border-accent-blue bg-dark-surface/50 p-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-text-primary">
            <strong>Cascadia Systems is a one-engineer practice in Portland, Oregon. We build the
            systems that sit between an organization's people and its data: pipelines,
            integrations, document extraction, and internal tools that replace work done by
            hand.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who runs this -->
  <section class="section border-t border-dark-border">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Who Runs This</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-text-primary">Devin MacArthur</strong> is a data-systems engineer.
            His day-to-day work is the data platform and automation behind a 41,000-member
            statewide organization: a daily pipeline over a Salesforce-based CRM, a routing layer
            that links field staff to the 230 local units they serve, automated financial analysis
            across 216 school districts, an AI document extractor that turns scanned applications
            into records, and the platform behind the organization's largest annual governance
            event.
          </p>
          <p>
            Outside that work he runs a personal operations system built on agentic AI tooling,
            local AI infrastructure on hardware he owns, and a field-data lab with a mapping drone
            and a LiDAR scanner. He has graduate training in urban studies and spatial analysis at
            Portland State University.
          </p>
          <p>
            The person who scopes your engagement is the one who builds it, documents it, and
            trains your team on it. There are no handoffs because there is no one to hand off to.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Principles -->
  <section class="section bg-dark-surface">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold">How We Work</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-text-secondary">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Sit with the people who do the work</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Every engagement starts with interviews, not requirements documents. The process
              as it actually runs is never the process on the org chart.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Production or nothing</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We do not deliver prototypes. What ships runs on a schedule, logs what it did,
              handles the errors that will happen, and comes with a runbook.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Your data stays yours</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Read-only access first. Sensitive processing in your environment or on
              infrastructure we own. Hosted AI only under a data-processing agreement. Everything
              built is handed to you, credentials rotated, working copies deleted.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Say so when it's a spreadsheet</h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Not every problem needs software, and most do not need AI. The roadmap says which
              is which, and the free call does too.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The lab -->
  <section class="section border-t border-dark-border">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">The Lab</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          <p>
            Cascadia Systems began as Cascadia Mobile Research, a field-data lab pairing drone and
            LiDAR capture with spatial processing on infrastructure it owns. That work continues
            on the <a href="/field-data/" class="link">Field Data</a> page, and the
            <a href="/research/" class="link">lab notes</a> still publish methods, benchmarks, and
            negative results as they complete.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-text-primary">This is a working business, not a venture-backed
            startup.</strong> Cascadia Mobile Research LLC is a registered Oregon company. There
            is no growth-at-all-costs trajectory. The goal is a durable, competent practice that
            compounds slowly.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section class="section bg-dark-surface">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mb-8 text-text-secondary">
          <a href="mailto:devin.macarthur@cascadiasystems.org" class="link">devin.macarthur@cascadiasystems.org</a>
          &middot; we reply within two business days.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="/services/" class="btn btn-secondary">View Services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
